5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about relying on conditions we cannot control, like weather or transport.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,The location of our branches already dictates who can reach us.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,Why do we keep judging new ideas by how they sound?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Budgets often look fine on day one but thin out later.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,We need to check if staff actually have the skills for new tasks.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, yes, access is a major barrier for many residents.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, exactly. Every new commitment reshuffles who can participate.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I want to look at what we have already tried before.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I should examine how the funding is structured over time.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will check the volunteer register to see who is available.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look into winter road closures and bus links.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will investigate bus links and evening room bookings.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will check attendance sheets and the two old programmes.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will review the county grant terms and running lines.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will look at the volunteer register and tool certification.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Let us see what the data says before we decide.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,Agreed. The physical constraints are real.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I hope we find some useful records from the past.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Logic over emotion, please. Let the numbers speak.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,We must ensure we are not overloading the current team.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
