60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Candidate A, the Mobile Branch, seems risky given the winter closures.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Candidate B, the Maker Workshop, requires tool certification we currently lack.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Candidate C, Language Circles, aligns with the successful evening groups.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Candidate D, the Digital Archive, has a history of incomplete indexing.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Candidate C needs facilitators, which we have, but supervision is a gap.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, the evening groups are a good model, but are they scalable?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, we can train supervisors, but it takes time and money.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shizue, the attendance sheets show high demand for outreach-style services.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Jonathan, the grant covers session fees, which fits a recurring program like C.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, yes, but we must ensure the skills are on the roster.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"I am leaning towards C, as it leverages existing community strength.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I also prefer C, as it doesn't rely on vehicle logistics.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Rin,,I vote for C. It builds on what already works.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,C is the most financially sustainable given the grant terms.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minako,,"I will support C, provided we address the supervision training.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,"Let us proceed with C, but with a clear training plan.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,Agreed. It respects the access constraints we face.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Rin,,I am happy to help organize the first few sessions.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,I will draft the budget line to match the grant structure.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Minako,,I will coordinate with the volunteer register to assign supervisors.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
